      "body": "## Motivation\r\n\r\nOn Ascend 950, the DSpArk draft C1 path reads quantized shared-KV cache but currently calls the generic sparse-attention operator. Route that path through the dedicated `sgl-kernel-npu` quantized operator and its host metadata scheduler. This change depends on [sgl-kernel-npu PR #876](https://github.com/sgl-project/sgl-kernel-npu/pull/876).\r\n\r\n## Modifications\r\n\r\n- Add `is_dspark` to `_sparse_attn_ops()` and select `torch.ops.npu.kv_quant_sparse_attn_sharedkv_metadata_host` and `torch.ops.npu.kv_quant_sparse_attn_sharedkv` only for Ascend 950 DSpArk draft C1. Other attention paths retain their existing operators.\r\n- Pass contiguous CPU `int32` query/KV length mirrors to host metadata while keeping NPU length tensors for the attention call.\r\n- Check wheel import and operator registration in `extra_ops_loader.py` from DSpArk worker initialization, matching the structure of randgun/sglang#33. Validate query, packed KV, sinks, and metadata before dispatch, and make non-contiguous queries contiguous.\r\n\r\nThis ports the integration from [randgun/sglang#33](https://github.com/randgun/sglang/pull/33) onto the current upstream `main` without the other changes from the `br_dsv4_950` branch.\r\n\r\n## Accuracy Tests\r\n\r\nThe current upstream-based branch has not been run on Ascend NPU yet. The earlier fork integration was exercised separately; those results do not validate this rebased branch.\r\n\r\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\r\n\r\nNo benchmark has been run for this upstream-based branch.\r\n\r\n## Validation\r\n\r\n- Python syntax and `ruff check --select F401,F821,F823,UP037` passed.\r\n- `ruff format --check` and `git diff --check` passed.\r\n- NPU unit and end-to-end tests remain to be run after installing the wheel from [sgl-kernel-npu PR #876](https://github.com/sgl-project/sgl-kernel-npu/pull/876).\r\n\r\n## Checklist\r\n\r\n- [x] Format code according to the repository style.\r\n- [ ] Run Ascend NPU accuracy and end-to-end tests on this upstream-based branch.\r\n- [ ] Benchmark performance on this upstream-based branch.\r\n\r\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\r\n---\r\n### CI States\r\n\r\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:hourglass_flowing_sand: [Run #40494844615](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40494844615)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\r\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:hourglass_flowing_sand: [Run #40494843951](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40494843951)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\r\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:hourglass_flowing_sand: [Run #40494843936](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40494843936)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\r\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
